    rdfs:label "Candidate dataset: IUPHAR/BPS Guide to Pharmacology" ;
    dct:description "curated gating and ligand data for voltage-gated channels and connexins used to parameterize a memory simulation" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.guidetopharmacology.org/> .
